Package: sharebox
Version: @VERSION@
Architecture: @ARCH@
Maintainer: @MAINTAINER@
Installed-Size: @INSTALLED_SIZE@
Depends: @DEPENDS@
Section: net
Priority: optional
Homepage: https://github.com/Bolutifebabs8/ShareBox
Description: Share files between this PC and nearby phones over Wi-Fi
 ShareBox turns this computer into a local-network file share. Phones,
 tablets and other computers on the same Wi-Fi open a browser, pair once
 with a QR code, and can then browse, download and upload files.
 .
 Files never leave the local network - there is no cloud service and no
 app to install on the phone. Paired devices are remembered and can be
 renamed or revoked from the Control Center on this computer.
